  <item>
    <title>公考体检出癌症，她决定这样活下去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6899613520a2906a4de953e3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6899613520a2906a4de953e3</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 03:20:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好！这里是啵啵啵啵克儿，欢迎来到《和陌生人说话》专题第五期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们想和你介绍一位新朋友，她叫@贝拉，一位人生经历非常特别的女孩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她经历编制考试，体检却查出疑似癌症。走出传统家庭，独自在大城市生活，经历高压工作、gap month、联合开咖啡馆，她觉得自己越来越活出自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期对谈】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：嘎嘎&amp;李同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：贝拉</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a>：特别的经历？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">06:07</a>：被通知体检结果，大脑一片空白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> ：不要美化没有走过的路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="873">14:33</a>：也曾想过为什么癌症找上了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1210">20:10</a>：得病之后，任何事情和健康相比都无足轻重了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a>：过度关注带来的是过度控制，自由永远一体两面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a>：为什么大家都爱去西藏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a>：我好像不会生气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a>：和好朋友合伙开店，友情必然面临着挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">80:00</a>：你永远有后悔的机会，勇敢点！</span></p>]]></description>
