  <item>
    <title>揭秘直播行业：007作息、金钱、大哥与不能说的秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687d127ea12f9ff06a20a07d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687d127ea12f9ff06a20a07d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽，大家好。欢迎来到啵啵啵啵克儿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是【和陌生人对话】系列第4期，我们邀请到嘉宾@噗噗，他曾在某著名大厂负责直播风控和财税项目，为大家一起揭秘直播行业内幕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期对谈】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：嘎嘎&amp;李同学</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：噗噗&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间戳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">00:03:39</a> 上班时间007</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">00:08:14</a> 年终奖40多个月？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">00:12:40</a> 识别"杀猪盘"直播间的小窍门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">00:20:48</a> 直播行业的政策变革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">00:34:37</a> 直播打赏背后的消费心理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">00:38:15</a> 主播收入不够看病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2545">00:42:25</a> 你愿意让渡多少私人生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">00:52:17</a> 主播的收入分成与税务考量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3587">00:59:47</a> 成功背后的巨大代价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3934">01:05:34</a> 职场恋爱，请提交审批</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4219">01:10:19</a> 直播行业的未来走向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4457">01:14:17</a> 过来人给应届生的一句话</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会不定时出品新鲜、有趣的嘚吧嘚，内容涵盖电视剧、综艺、娱乐热点、书籍以及我们当下的生活等等。谢谢大家收听我们的啵啵啵啵克儿，祝大家天天开心！</span></p>]]></description>
