    <guid isPermaLink="false">6804d1f31f1db84a5670fd16</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 11:21:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期老友回归，主播@嘎嘎邀请到了老朋友@宁屿 @富婆，一起回顾过去四年间的成长与变化。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期时间戳（AI提供，感恩AI）：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a>:回归客套ing</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">00:06:19</a>:旧自我与长期主义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">00:12:40</a>:做好预期管理，工作不枯燥了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">00:19:01</a>:放弃和别人比较，终于获得了自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">00:25:22</a>:旅行更重要的是和谁去，而不是去哪里打卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1902">00:31:42</a>:富婆的浪漫首尔之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2282">00:38:02</a>:北欧：太冷了，达咩~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">00:44:23</a>:从打工人到合伙人的心态转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3044">00:50:44</a>:情绪正面与负面≠情绪正确与错误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">00:57:06</a>:情绪的主人还是情绪的俘虏：探索情绪的稳定与不稳定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3806">01:03:26</a>:让情绪穿过我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4187">01:09:47</a>:探索情绪，其实是探索自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4580">01:16:20</a>:我不是看面相，我是容貌焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5154">01:25:54</a>:真正冻龄的秘密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5724">01:35:24</a>:2025年最想实现的三件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6301">01:45:01</a>:朋友还是越老越醇越香</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>往期回顾：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《寒冬求职焦虑？普通深漂女生的裸辞/求职/旅居经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63a2fa859acee6cd2f84dc51" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/63a2fa859acee6cd2f84dc51"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《非漂一年，村里传我承包金矿（假）</span></p><span></span><p><span>》</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67320d9df373fe5d4d7631ea" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/67320d9df373fe5d4d7631ea"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>谢谢大家收听我们的啵啵啵啵克儿，祝大家健健康康、天天开心！</span></blockquote>]]></description>
