  <item>
    <title>追星特辑01.揭秘与偶像近距离接触的N种方式</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6800ef1ccdd692da15fbe3e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6800ef1ccdd692da15fbe3e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 12:16:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中，主播李同学和3位追星女孩，一同分享了追星故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何获得与偶像近距离接触的机会？你是亲妈粉还是女友粉？当我们追星时我们到底在追什么？第一次见偶像的紧张与激动，追星过程中遇到的种种挑战与乐趣，追星背后的真实感受和经验……敬请收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a>:商场里的活动，让我与本命意外相遇！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">00:12:48</a>:我给爱豆过生日：近距离追星的奇妙体验！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">00:25:34</a>:怎样才能见到我的爱豆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">00:31:59</a>:从偶像到榜样，爱豆如何影响我们的人生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2304">00:38:24</a>:追星的心情，单纯又复杂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">00:44:47</a>:理性追星or不理性追星？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">00:51:12</a>:爱豆被黑，友谊重聚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">01:04:00</a>:一起追星的小伙伴，是爱豆给我的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4222">01:10:22</a>:爱豆塌房了？你是不是爱错了人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：《给电影人的情书》蔡琴</span></p>]]></description>
